    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Tracer vaccines administered - this and last 5 years\" for Trainingland, with doses administered by year for six series: BCG, DPT-HepB-HIB 1, DPT-HepB-HIB 3, MR 1, MR 2 and yellow fever doses given. Data run from 2013 to 2016, and every series rises. The highest line rises from about 293 000 in 2013 to roughly 380 000 in 2016; the lowest, MR 2, rises from 184 016 to 251 824. Other labelled values are 305 383, 344 559, 362 425, 379 207, 250 702, 268 074, 269 780, 229 531, 203 808 and 285 677; several lines overlap, so which label belongs to which series is not certain from the image.",
